# Blade of Darkness at Prog 0: the Zeruhn zone-in 130 with a full inventory (the Chaosbringer does not fit: Prog 0 kept),
# then again with room (Chaosbringer, Prog 1).
lists ZeruhnMines/onZoneIn/1 ZeruhnMines/onEventFinish/130
char zone=PalboroughMines pos=250.037,-32.069,174.156 lvl=30
quest Bastok.BladeOfDarkness accepted
login
fill-inventory
warp 1,0,3 ZeruhnMines               # 130: the inventory full, nothing given, Prog 0
free-inventory
warp 250.037,-32.069,174.156 PalboroughMines
warp 1,0,3 ZeruhnMines               # 130 again: Chaosbringer, Prog 1
